Z||000001||loafer87gt||02-24-2000||11:57 AM||||Hate to be the bearer of bad news, but you can't finish the game. Because of the designers haste to get the game out on the shelves before Christmas they shipped the game with a bunch of bugs. The last percent your looking for is supposed to be the drag racing segment, that had to be cut out. Sony has admitted their mistake and is offering a replacement disk with the bugs fixed. Some of the other things that it fixes is the problem with the game not saving track high scores. Check out sony's web page for their number and give em a call. Good luch||||reg||1
